===Noun===
'''cosmetics'''

# [[preparation|Preparation]]s [[applied]] [[externally]] to [[change]] or [[enhance]] the [[beauty]] of [[skin]], [[hair]], [[nail]]s, [[lip]]s, and [[eyes]].
# The [[study]] of such products.

